{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dino & Chill",
    "steam_appid": 3613170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd95 Dino &amp; Chill \ud83e\udd96</strong><br><strong>Relax. Hatch dinos. Embrace the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dino &amp; Chill</i> \u2013 the ultimate laid-back dinosaur sim where cozy vibes meet prehistoric fun. Collect and name adorable dinos, build up your sanctuary, and watch as your scaly companions roam, poop, and live their best Jurassic lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're managing your growing herd, opening surprise daily chests, or just vibing with your favorite dinos, there's always something delightful happening in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Chill Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No pressure. No timers. Just you, your dinos, and the sweet sounds of prehistoric peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 <strong>Collect Them All</strong> \u2013 Discover a growing list of cute, quirky dinosaurs \u2013 from classics to rare retirees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>Dino Poo Happens</strong> \u2013 Yes, your dinos poop. Yes, it's important. Yes, we balanced it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Daily Surprises</strong> \u2013 Log in daily for a shot at gems, perks, and free goodies (or maybe nothing at all \ud83d\udc40).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Name &amp; Nurture</strong> \u2013 Give your dinos custom names and build a park that reflects your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you're here to collect, customize, or just chill with dinos, this is your happy place.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd95 Dino &amp; Chill \ud83e\udd96</strong><br><strong>Relax. Hatch dinos. Embrace the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dino &amp; Chill</i> \u2013 the ultimate laid-back dinosaur sim where cozy vibes meet prehistoric fun. Collect and name adorable dinos, build up your sanctuary, and watch as your scaly companions roam, poop, and live their best Jurassic lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're managing your growing herd, opening surprise daily chests, or just vibing with your favorite dinos, there's always something delightful happening in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Chill Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No pressure. No timers. Just you, your dinos, and the sweet sounds of prehistoric peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 <strong>Collect Them All</strong> \u2013 Discover a growing list of cute, quirky dinosaurs \u2013 from classics to rare retirees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>Dino Poo Happens</strong> \u2013 Yes, your dinos poop. Yes, it's important. Yes, we balanced it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Daily Surprises</strong> \u2013 Log in daily for a shot at gems, perks, and free goodies (or maybe nothing at all \ud83d\udc40).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Name &amp; Nurture</strong> \u2013 Give your dinos custom names and build a park that reflects your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you're here to collect, customize, or just chill with dinos, this is your happy place.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Hatch and collect adorable dinosaurs that roam your screen while you work or play! Watch them gather gems, unlock perks, and customize your setup. Move and resize them freely, even across multiple monitors. But be careful\u2014these dinos can get messy, so don\u2019t forget to clean up after them!",
